    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng gár tiwa hariím tin kilooeé' xirfayeemiís, tam adoorí gár i bu' i kahha. Ala daxta aníng a kumiít axweesanto kángw iigu'utu nee geehhooeemisuuduú Aako naa aníng i laqán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng heeko wák u xuú' oo baraá Kristo. Kureeraá mibaá nee tsiyáhh naa waarahhii'i heewí kuna ar tláy gawaá doori ay baraá dooraá tám. (Inós qoomaadae tim slaqwtá kón, aníng a xuaaká, laqaá tim slaqwtá konká, aníng a xuaaká, Mungú ga xuu'.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng heewí u xuú'. (Ala inós tim slaqwtá kón, laqaá tim slaqwtá konká, aníng a xuaaká, Mungú ga xuu'.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng a xuú' adór inós kura ar tláy ay didá' amohhoo'. Axweesanoó ooaro ta aleeslayká guri axamiís, axweesanaydá' tawa ya/anká hee nguwa axweesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daanduú heewihe aníng ti xirfayeemiís, ala aníng ti kilooeé' xirfayeemisaaká, ala aqo har daqaatlakwer'eé' kilós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala aníng tam ti kilooeé' xirfayeemisa, aníng a adór daktantooká, asma gár aníng ni oo' a ar ló'. Ala aníng ti máw kilooeé' xirfayeemisuuwo, as hee miwa oó' ti ak úr ta adoodá' ir ara'ari, nee i axamiisi dir'eene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geehhoeemisuudá' urén oo tinda aníng i haniís i ló'wa waa/oo/amór kón. Gawaá adoorihe laqaymo kunguna gawaá slaqwte'eénií dahaás, as aníng mawa daar/uút as daanduú geehhoeemisuudá'. Laqaymoowí naa sláw a malaykamoó Neetlaangw, oo tinda ya/aáw as aníng iwa slahhi, as aníng mawa daara/uút. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá daanduú gaarihe aníng Aako una firiím sagaáwa tám wa ale, as gaarí iwa qutl dir'eene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala Aako iri báy, «Gurtleemuueé' i bu'uut diroge. Asma /uuruueé' ku ak úr, kuúng burtu daqaatlaákw.» Gawaá adoorihe aníng tin xirfayeemiís ar qwal/uú yaariír as daqaatlakwer'eé', as /uuruú Kristo iwa baraaeé' wa hooti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe aníng a qwalaá/ aníng barnaxes ti daqaatlaákw, laqaá tam ti muruú tlákw i tlehhiít, laqaá tam a daawimiít, laqaá tam ti gusiisín, nee laqaá tam ti slahh'eemiís as Kristo. Asma aníng barnaxes ti daqaatlaákw, daqaní aníng a /uuruú koóm.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng niwa adoorír axweés a adór daktani. Ala kuungá' aníng ina harakesé'. A hariímarhúng geeraawo aníng iwa xirfayeemisa'. Asma aníng tam a gaarookahe, ala gár aníng iga wa /aaruur i káhh ta ya/abuuserhúng tidá' urene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár aníng gadiyeé ngiwa tleéhh tla/angwhúng wa ale, tlehhemi'iidá' sleémeero ina tleéhh ar qiqtliingw, kudá' aníng i laqaqaamá' adór tar ya/abusmo. Layu ina tleéhh, nee tlehhema'aá waa/oo/amo, nee tlehhema'aá aleesleemuú laqaaqamá'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gár dirhunge aníng naa /itiím i káhh, baraá tidá' naa haniís dír múk kríshaanáy oo yaamaá hatlae. Ala aqo har tí kilós, kuungá' naa huwár ar awiiká. Án gurtlawaaré' as nuwa sadakuús adoorír alé.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qaytsité', gaarí a sagaáwa tám aníng niwa amorhúngií daqeemuú slaa'. Nee án kuungá' nu huwár ar awaaká. Asma aníng gár ni leelehhiit a muruuhungeeká, ala a kuungá'. Asma a hariímarooká na/ii mura' nguwa burumburina' as xwaylité, ala a xwaylité mura' gun burumburiín as na/ii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng barte'eene a qwalaá/ muruueé' sleémeero nguwa haniis, nee slám ánuú kilá' tiwa haniis as munerhúng. Xáy, kuungá' sla'aarirhúng i /aaruúra dir'eene, as adoorí án kuungá' nuwa ak ló'wa slaa'?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuungá' a kata', «Ar ló', kuúng taa huwár ar eeriiká. Ala as kuúng tawa al/aymusmo, kuúng atén taa al/ák ar lamtók.» ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahaá, garhúng ar aníng naa sláw iqo deéro dír dabaá mukdá' aníng naa amorhúngií ya/aawi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng Tito una firiím niwa amorhúng i daqay, nee hhiyaaduú hatlá' una ya/aáw nee inós tiwa kona'. Xáy, Tito gár dirhunge aa sláy i deéro? Qeeruú hhoohhoó' oo Mungú kudá' aníng i geeraharahaár, a kudá' inós sleeme gu geeraharahaáraáke? Nee slám hotaangós a adór kwe'eeneekáhe?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Án ngi slaá' qoomaarí sleémeero kuungá' a kata' atén gár tas adoorír axweesaan a tin kiloorén aleekal/aamaán dír geeraahunge, aasla'áy, a adoosingeeká. Tí ta axweesaan, an axweesaán ar baraá Kristo, dír geeraá Mungú wa ale. Ala sla'aaruuser'eé', tí sleémeero ana axweesaán as kuungá' tawa kwa/a'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma aníng gár ni da'ayumiit a tí, án binda amorhúngií hardáh, án kuungá' adoodá' nur slaa' dooqa nu adoodá' i awaaká. Nee slám a da'ayumiít as kuungá' aníng iwa aanda' ar adoodá' kuungá' ta sla'a'aaká. A da'ayumiít dooqa án kuungá' dír ni aw a baraá gila, nee gur'e nuwa ohiin, nee xaraasleema, nee fola, nee tloqmis, nee kaantiingw, nee daara/aangw nee tlaahhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng a da'ayumiít asma binda malé hardáh amorhúng, Munguúeé' aníng i malé mureekees dirhunge, nee aníng niri gurhaamuút as múk yaariír oo aa hhu'u'unká tam ay hamí, kudá' tlakweema gaa tlehhiit iimír qoomaadá', tari kumiít baraá slasla/aruuine, nee baraá tsaatu'uumaro nee tam baraá fuqti'ín tidá' taa tlehhiiti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
